act/">Have us build your shortlist</a></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="find-your-town"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Find your town">Which town near Myrtle Beach fits what you want?</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Each place here leads on something different: the sand, the land, newer houses or a short drive.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">A typical house, on this page, is the one in the middle: half sold for more and half for less.</p><div class="c3t-find" id="find"><div class="c3t-chips" role="group" aria-label="What you want" hidden><button type="button" class="c3t-chip" data-k="b1" aria-pressed="false">Up to $300,000</button><button type="button" class="c3t-chip" data-k="b2" aria-pressed="false">$300,000 to $450,000</button><button type="button" class="c3t-chip" data-k="b3" aria-pressed="false">Over $450,000</button><button type="button" class="c3t-chip" data-k="sand" aria-pressed="false">Beach in 10 minutes</button><button type="button" class="c3t-chip" data-k="land" aria-pressed="false">Acre lots common</button><button type="button" class="c3t-chip" data-k="new" aria-pressed="false">Builders selling now</button><button type="button" class="c3t-chip" data-k="dry" aria-pressed="false">Few in a flood zone</button><button type="button" class="c3t-chip" data-k="nohoa" aria-pressed="false">Mostly no HOA fee</button><button type="button" class="c3t-chip" data-k="cost" aria-pressed="false">Lowest yearly cost</button></div><p class="c3t-count" aria-live="polite" hidden></p><p class="c3t-none" hidden>No place has all of these. Remove one choice to see the closest.</p><div class="c3t-tw"><div class="c3t-pick2" hidden><label>Show: <select data-a="data-a"><option value="price" selected>Typical house</option><option value="yearly">Year