tax, the county fee, insurance, the HOA fee and upkeep, for a house you live in outside the flood zone.</p><p class="c3t-note">Minutes are by car from a typical house, with no traffic; summer traffic on US 17 adds time. A hospital is the nearest of Grand Strand Medical Center, Conway Medical Center, McLeod Health Loris, McLeod Health Seacoast and Tidelands Waccamaw Community Hospital. In a flood zone: the share of houses in FEMA's high-risk flood zone.</p><nav class="c3t-jump" aria-label="On this page"><div><b>Go to a place:</b> <a href="#loris">Loris</a> &middot; <a href="#aynor">Aynor</a> &middot; <a href="#longs">Longs</a> &middot; <a href="#little-river">Little River</a> &middot; <a href="#conway">Conway</a> &middot; <a href="#north-myrtle-beach">North Myrtle Beach</a> &middot; <a href="#carolina-forest">Carolina Forest</a> &middot; <a href="#myrtle-beach">Myrtle Beach</a> &middot; <a href="#socastee">Socastee</a> &middot; <a href="#surfside-beach">Surfside Beach</a> &middot; <a href="#garden-city">Garden City</a> &middot; <a href="#murrells-inlet">Murrells Inlet</a> &middot; <a href="#pawleys-litchfield">Pawleys Island</a></div><div><b>Further down:</b> <a href="#compare">Compare</a> &middot; <a href="#yearly-cost">Yearly cost</a> &middot; <a href="#city-or-county">City or county</a> &middot; <a href="#questions-about-the-towns">Questions about the towns</a></div></nav></div><script>(function(){var f=document.getElementById("find");if(!f)return;var cs=f.querySelector(".c3t-chips"),ct=f.querySelector(".c3t-count"),no=f.querySelector(".c3t-none"),tb=f.querySelector("table.c3t-cmp"),bd=tb.tBodies[0],rows=[].slice.call(bd.rows),pk=f.querySelector(".c3t-pick2");cs.hidden=false;pk.hidden=false;var B=["b1","b2","b3"];function run(){var on=[].slice.call(cs.querySelectorAll('[aria-pressed="true"]')).map(function(b){return b.getAttribute("data-k")}),n=0;rows.forEach(function(r){var t=" "+r.getAttribute("data-tags")+" ",ok=on.every(function(k){return t.indexOf(" "+k+" ")>