in="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M10.8 12.2 20 3M16.8 6.2l2.5 2.5M14.3 8.7l2 2"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="15.5" r="4.5"/></svg></span><span>Nearly every house in the city is outside the zones that allow rentals under 90 days.</span></li></ul><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">In the city, houses sold for about $535,000 at the middle of the past year.</p><div class="c3t-act"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Myrtle%20Beach">Send me houses in Myrtle Beach<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p><a class="c3t-back" href="#find-your-town">Back to the comparison</a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)"><div class="wrap"><div style="border-left:3px solid var(--brass);background:var(--ivory);padding:1.2rem 1.4rem;margin:1.8rem 0;max-width:720px"><p style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.4rem">Is the house you like inside the city?</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.8rem">Send us the address. We tell you which side of the city line it is on, and what that changes.</p><a class="btn btn-brass" href="/contact/">Ask us about an address</a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory)" id="socastee"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Socastee"><span class="c3t-n">9<span class="c3t-sr">. </span></span><span class="c3t-pn">Socastee</span><span class="c3t-tg"><span class="c3t-sr">: </span>a historic village on the waterway</span></h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Socastee began in the late 1800s as a lumber and turpentine camp. Its old swing bridge, built in the mid-1930s, carries Dick Pond Road over the Intracoastal Waterway. The bridge, two houses, a store and a pecan grove make up a historic district on the National Register.</p><div class="c3t-ph"><div class="c3-aerial"><figure class="c3ph-hero" style=""><div class="c3ph-f"><img src="/images/2026-11-a/buyers-relocating-which-town/socastee-swing-bridge-from-above-1200w.webp" srcset="/images/2026-11-a/buyers-relocating-which-town/socastee-swing-bridge-from-above-600w.webp 600w, /images/2026-11-a/buyers-relocating-which-town/socastee-swing-bridge-from-above-1200w.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 899px) calc(100vw - 64px), 460px" width="1200" height="900" alt="Aerial photo of a blue steel truss swing bridge carrying a two-lane road over the Intracoastal Waterway at Socastee, with a newer four-lane bridge at the lower left and houses at the upper left" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="c3ph-cr"><a href="https://www.fsa.usda.gov/help/policies-and-links/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="U.S. government aerial photo, 2023. License: Public domain" title="License: Public domain">U.S. government aerial photo, 2023</a></span></div><figcaption>The old Socastee swing bridge, the blue steel span, on the Intracoastal Waterway, with the newer highway bridge at the lower left.</figcaption></figure></div></div><dl class="c3t-kf"><div><dt><span class="i"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 11.5 12 3.5l9 8M5.5 10v10.5h13V10M10 20.5V15h4v5.5"/></svg></span>Typical house</dt> <dd>$300,000</dd></div> <div><dt><span class="i"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" 